item(72,[72],'reading question',[116,119,122],['820-859','925-936','984-1014'],'le groupe F2³ opère dessus','The calculated finite group is the even-parity subgroup acting on three quadratic factors. No map to modular-curve levels, projective congruence kernels, regular-polyhedron structures orGT actions is exhibited.','The LM2/LM4 contextual register references are preserved as unverified project leads only.','agrees','The source’s actual action supplies no objectwise comparison with the named congruence problems.')
