narrative(94,143,['2000'],'Contrairement à ce dont je croyais ...','He retracts placing a destructive-force intuition in the preceding meditation and places it hours after the reunion.','The abandoned recollection and correction are both stated in this paragraph; no missing earlier sentence is reconstructed.',kind='withdrawn in the same text')
