narrative(96,143,['2006'],'il me semble; près de trois ans','He says the insight receded from attention and that the wordenfancedid not recur in his notes for almostthree years.','His own account distinguishes a moment of insight from sustained transformation.')
narrative(97,145,['2114-2116'],'jusqu’à présent deux grandes forces','He provisionally enumerates two repressive forces, developing feminine-trait repression on this leaf.','The other force is associated with earlier childhood-burial discussion, but is not a second explicit numbered entry here.')
